{"parse": {"title": "AFF-19", "pageid": 123515, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-18\" title=\"AFF-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-19</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-20\" title=\"AFF-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">19</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8B.B1.E9.9B.84.E4.B9.8B.E6.97.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"英雄之旅\">英雄之旅</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 英雄之旅</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Hero's Journey</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>故<span class=\"color-value\"></span>事<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>头<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>美<span class=\"color-value\"></span>妙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>称<span class=\"color-value\"></span>号<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>造<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>桂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>赋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>予<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span><br /><span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>没<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210119</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>看来您不想为其他人的性命负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您让我来决定，如果我拒绝，就是我杀了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个问题比预料中来得更直接。贝丽尔稍作思考，再次点头确认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你们的确很相似。关于那份求生的意志，以及一些面对命运的有趣反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>正因为相似，费利西安才能持久地借用你的躯体，影响你的意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这样合适的机会再没有第二次了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她向阿黛拉伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>如果我没有猜错，你的朋友和曾经的费利西安死于同一个原因。此刻她应当回到了迷思海之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>留下费利西安，她会成为一个合适的研究对象，也许你能找到带回朋友的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>或让她以凶手的身份死去。往后的日子，你不必再受折磨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那……请您发誓吧。您承诺这些话都是真的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一双恳切的眼睛，对上另一双平静而纯粹的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我无法承诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你应该清楚，神秘术的能力是有限的。你无法鉴别一句话或一颗心的真伪，正如我此刻看不清命运的流向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>抓紧时间。把那颗钻石给我，或抛弃它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉犹豫着抬起胳膊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>费利西安没有再说话。也许她现在已不能开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低着头，阿黛拉第一次见到她垂下头颅。<br />熟悉的、趾高气昂的神采从她身上消退了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烦躁、疲倦与无处着落的愤怒席卷而来。<br />最终，它们变成一声叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……拿去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她能确信自己怨恨费利西安。但她也并不期望看到这样的屈服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>请您救她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钻石落入手心，贝丽尔合拢手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你们为我找到了答案。我会拿出相应的诚意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我说过很多次，你们的命运正在交汇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你在精神王国的旅途已经到了尽头……但仍然可以留在物质世界的王冠之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>现在，到达世界尽头的灵性，该前往下一个世界了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>收下它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>作为你冒险之旅的勋章。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-3_2_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>是吗……勋章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钻石重新回到她的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它带着血迹、温度、泪水。它是她最后唯一拥有的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>但您的眼睛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>不必担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>就像你之前说的，我走在岸上太久，对这份注视水流的能力习以为常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>自以为能看清命运，可能比他人更容易受命运摆弄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>所以我决定尽可能地看最后一次。就是这次了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑着指了指阿黛拉握紧的钻石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>一个小小的“仿制品”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你的火焰将法兰西之蓝与它暂时寄身的烟晶分离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我只能为它另寻一副可寄宿的壳，希望你不介意白水晶制成的仿钻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>也希望你和费利西安都会满意它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她还会醒来吗？我还会像之前那样产生幻觉，看见她和我说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>不再有幻觉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>她会醒来，只是需要些时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>现在你是躯体，她是偷偷依附于你的精神。你们待在一起，她也许不会因灵与肉分离而被抹去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>所以别让她离你太远。否则这个小漏洞早晚会被发觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钻石的棱角刺痛了手指。阿黛拉感到指尖的血管在抽动，连带着心脏一同拧紧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切诚如预言所示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>连这颗蓝钻也很好地履行了它命定的职责，纠缠着它的所有者，成为一个如影随形的诅咒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>雨很快就会落下。该离开了。明天它的清洗便会完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我很喜欢你的结局。但是否要跟上，这是你的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当戏剧落幕，观众也该适时离场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔一直遵守着这套规则，她不打算为谁改变习惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>——贝丽尔女士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您知道那个说法吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>人类的祖先是猿猴。我们都是由猴子进化而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那么世界上第一只猴子从何而来？它最远的祖先是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>再往回推算呢？世界上最早的生命是如何诞生的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>像这样不断溯源，能找到“最初的生命”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您看，有许多事情都无法找出那个所谓的、唯一的、完全准确的决定因素。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>生命的诞生很复杂，受到许多条件的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我觉得命运也是同样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>还没到结束的时候呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朋友、家乡、诅咒或预言，她曾有的期待与抗拒，都被一场雨变得不再重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果眼前只剩这个解释，只有先抓住它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使这只是一根轻飘飘的蛛丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>请您带上我。告诉我该怎么躲过您口中的“暴雨”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她喊出了这句话——塔沃尼尔的诅咒或许已经触发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这就是命运安排的目标。一个值得为之而死的目标。<br />雨水带走了一切，也终止了漫长的等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在熟悉的生活被碾磨殆尽之后，她的冒险真正开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我可以为您寻找您想要的宝石、答案、一切东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>作为报酬，你想从我这儿得到什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>“暴雨”的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她立刻给出了答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我只想弄明白它，让我的朋友和……费利西安回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她的结局不该在这里。只是消失，对她来说……太轻松了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师听完了每一个字，点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>即使最后可能一无所获，你也要和我一起离开吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>总不能干等着糟糕的事发生，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那条躲藏许久的小龙攀上她的肩膀，吐出一枚火球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>是。而且，每个时代都不会缺少追逐宝石与水晶的客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我的店里还缺一名能找到珍贵宝石的员工。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我们该往哪儿去，贝丽尔女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>往前开。穿过人群，离开这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我会为你找出那条正确的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>为您服务，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>旅途愉快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔最后望了一眼狂欢的人群。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这座城市只是她用于安放自己的地方，一个盛放珍贵水晶的珠宝盒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她还是愿意再花些时间记住它——这一点儿时间，已经足够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她靠在副驾驶，闭上眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_42.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_42\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_42\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_2_at_42.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_42.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_2_at_42.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_42.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_2_at_42.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_42.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>接下来的很长时间里，我应该无法提供过去那样详细准确的占卜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但“看不见”的感觉比想象中要好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>如果的确有某个掌管命运的存在，我想祂也许是个瞎子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车载收音机的歌声开始流淌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313422.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313422.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>希望我醒来的时候，你已经到达了目的地。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-19"}}